<main>
  <div class="hero"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div>
  <div class="search-panel" style="line-height:1.7; color:var(--text);">
    <p><strong>What we collect:</strong> When you create an account, we store your email address and an encrypted password. When you search, we do not track your queries beyond what's needed to serve results.</p>
    <p><strong>Carrier data:</strong> All carrier information shown (company name, phone, DOT/MC number, address) is public data sourced from the FMCSA (Federal Motor Carrier Safety Administration), a U.S. government agency. We do not create or verify this data ourselves.</p>
    <p><strong>Payment data:</strong> We do not store payment card details. Payments are confirmed manually or through a third-party payment processor, and account access is granted based on that confirmation.</p>
    <p><strong>Data sharing:</strong> We do not sell or share your account information with third parties.</p>
    <p><strong>Contact:</strong> For any privacy questions, reach out via the contact details in our footer.</p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.85rem;">Last updated: August 2026</p>
  </div>
</main>
<footer>Dotmanifest · Data sourced from FMCSA SAFER &amp; Open Data Program</footer>
